<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πακτ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πακτός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fasten, close</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				187
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶμα πάκτου</span>
			<i>make fast</i> the house, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				579
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχλοῖς καὶ κλῄθροισι τὰ προπύλαια π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					265
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stop up, caulk</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τετρημένα ῥακίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bind fast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαίφεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					10.23
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				Autom.
			</span></i>).</div>
